    "All known live queues are represented.",
    "All known active/in-progress campaigns are represented.",
    "Every item retains source_path and source_id.",
    "Items that cannot be classified are marked needs_mapping rather than guessed.",
    "No theorem/proof/lemma/campaign promotion occurs.",
    "python -m scripts.global_validate passes."
